# Nonsecret local API settings. Generate secrets outside tracked source.
EMBER_HOST=127.0.0.1
EMBER_PORT=5190
EMBER_ORIGIN=http://127.0.0.1:5188
EMBER_SESSION_SECURE=false
EMBER_SESSION_TTL_SECONDS=86400
# Password is the compatibility default; explicitly opt in to passwordless Serve:
EMBER_AUTH_MODE=password
# Required only for tailscale mode: exact Tailscale Serve owner login.
# EMBER_TAILSCALE_USER_LOGIN=owner@example.test
# Real tailscale mode also needs an exact https://<host>.<tailnet>.ts.net origin
# and EMBER_SESSION_SECURE=true. Loopback HTTP is for trusted local development.
# Required secrets, intentionally omitted:
# EMBER_DATABASE_URL (role and database ember_dev at 127.0.0.1:55439, never the
#   superuser; the live trial alone uses ember, configured outside the repository)
# EMBER_OWNER_PASSWORD_HASH (required in password mode only; Argon2id encoded hash, never plaintext)
# Compose reads apps/api/.postgres.env containing POSTGRES_USER, POSTGRES_DB,
# POSTGRES_PASSWORD. Both actual env files are ignored; restrict them to mode 0600.
